Experiment 2: Dijkstra Shortest Path Algorithm
Objective: Find the single-source shortest path in a weighted graph using priority queue optimization.
import heapq
def dijkstra(graph, start):
distances = {node: float('infinity') for node in graph}
distances[start] = 0
pq = [(0, start)]
while pq:
curr_dist, curr_node = heapq.heappop(pq)
if curr_dist > distances[curr_node]:
continue
